    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Craftedy | Loot &gt; Merge &gt; Fight  </strong><br><br>Merge, craft, and conquer the depths of hell! Divine Craftedy is a unique blend of merge mechanics, crafting, and survival action, set in a medieval fantasy world inspired by Dante\u2019s Divine Comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine and merge different materials to forge <strong>legendary weapons, powerful armor, and mystical artifacts</strong>. Every merge unlocks new crafting recipes, allowing you to strengthen your hero and dive deeper into the infernal abyss. Face relentless demonic hordes, master your strategy, and unleash divine power to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558090/extras/388a3f85f3a2e0a98af5484e1dc8d288.webp?t=1741356837\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558090/extras/c7f5254da7dbc2c27883ba54433cc54e.poster.avif?t=1741356837\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558090/extras/c7f5254da7dbc2c27883ba54433cc54e.webm?t=1741356837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558090/extras/c7f5254da7dbc2c27883ba54433cc54e.mp4?t=1741356837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558090/extras/b78bd311e6308f48ea5aa6ae17887acb.webp?t=1741356837\" width=600 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.